OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor quits over
OL,4,Aoffensive remarks
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This report contains racist
OL,7,Fand offensive language.
OL,9,FA Reform UK councillor filmed calling
OL,10,FAsian homeowners "parasites" has
OL,11,Fresigned from two councils and
OL,12,Fapologised for his comments.
OL,14,FAlan Feeney, who has since stepped down
OL,15,Ffrom the party, was heard making the
OL,16,Fremarks during undercover filming for
OL,17,Fan ITV News investigation in the run up
OL,18,Fto council elections in May.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
